 "method": "Each file opened alone with `open -a \"Microsoft PowerPoint\"` from a scratch folder, PowerPoint idle before each (no presentation or prompt open). A file counts as opened when its window stayed without a prompt for 10 seconds; the object model was then read. PowerPoint draws its repair prompt inside the document window, where accessibility exposes only the two buttons, or, after the window opened, as an alert; the drawn prompt was read from a capture of the window with macOS Vision. Cancel was chosen, no preference changed, nothing saved. The control was opened before the first variant and after the last. A first pass took the window of a deck whose prompt came later for an open deck and was discarded.",
